---
title: "open_obligation (Scallop Sui Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: assert_current_version(version)
    q_version --> q_create: (obligation, obligation_key) = obligation::new(ctx)
    q_create --> q_emit: emit ObligationCreatedEvent
    q_emit --> q_hot_potato: create ObligationHotPotato with obligation_id
    q_hot_potato --> [*]: return (obligation, obligation_key, hot_potato)

    note right of q_create
        INV-001: each obligation has a unique ID and corresponding key
        INV-002: obligation_key is the sole proof of ownership
    end note

    note right of q_hot_potato
        INV-003: ObligationHotPotato must be consumed in same transaction via return_obligation
        INV-004: return_obligation enforces obligation becomes shared object
        INV-005: hot potato pattern prevents obligation from being kept as owned object
    end note
